## Success Criteria

### Sprint Lock Requirements
- [ ] All 7 tests pass consistently (100% pass rate)
- [ ] Build passes without errors
- [ ] No critical regressions introduced
- [ ] Test execution time under 30 seconds total
- [ ] Visual regression tests pass
- [ ] Architecture integrity verified

### Definition of "Done"
- **Professional Architecture**: Test 0 passes
- **Functional Correctness**: Tests 1-3 pass
- **Cross-Device Compatibility**: Test 4 passes
- **Robustness**: Tests 5-6 pass
- **Production Ready**: All tests pass in CI/CD

